sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Manager as Operator Manager<br/>(controller-runtime)
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant TASCtrl as TrustyAIService<br/>Controller
    participant EHCtrl as EvalHub<br/>Controller
    participant LMCtrl as LMEvalJob<br/>Controller
    participant GorchCtrl as Guardrails<br/>Controller
    participant KRBACProxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant TASPod as TrustyAI Service Pod<br/>8080/TCP
    participant EHPod as EvalHub Pod
    participant LMPod as LMEval Driver Pod<br/>(FIPS)
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>InferenceService
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Manager: Startup: --enable-services<br/>selects TAS, EVALHUB controllers

    %% TrustyAIService Flow
    User->>K8sAPI: Create TrustyAIService CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: /convert (if version conversion needed)
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Converted CR
    K8sAPI->>TASCtrl: Watch notification
    TASCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment<br/>(trustyai-service + kube-rbac-proxy)
    TASCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Service (443→8443)
    TASCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Route
    TASCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceMonitor

    %% Authenticated access to TrustyAI
    User->>Route: HTTPS Request
    Route->>KRBACProxy: Forward (8443/TCP)
    KRBACProxy->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    K8sAPI-->>KRBACProxy: Auth result
    KRBACProxy->>TASPod: Proxy to 8080/TCP
    TASPod-->>KRBACProxy: Response
    KRBACProxy-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: HTTPS Response

    %% EvalHub Flow
    User->>K8sAPI: Create EvalHub CR
    K8sAPI->>EHCtrl: Watch notification
    EHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment + Service
    EHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create RBAC (Roles, RoleBindings, ClusterRoleBindings)
    EHCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create ServiceAccount

    %% LMEvalJob Flow
    User->>K8sAPI: Create LMEvalJob CR
    K8sAPI->>LMCtrl: Watch notification
    LMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Pod (driver binary, FIPS)
    LMCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create PVC (if needed)
    LMPod->>K8sAPI: Report status updates

    %% GuardrailsOrchestrator Flow
    User->>K8sAPI: Create GuardrailsOrchestrator CR
    K8sAPI->>GorchCtrl: Watch notification
    GorchCtrl->>KServe: Watch InferenceService state
    GorchCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment + ConfigMap
    GorchCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Route

    %% Health probes
    Note over Manager: Health: :8081/healthz, :8081/readyz
    Note over Webhook: Health: :9443/healthz
    Note over TASPod: Health: :8080/q/health/live,ready
